<%#
The notebook under the desk of a plate with a tablet of its own (app.js,
initNotebook): one entry per sum the plate's pairs make, the most seen first,
with how often and how it was spelled, and a letter to write against it. A
letter in pencil goes into the text line at once, in grey italics; Ask the
scribe confirms entries three at a time, and those go into ink, upright. Its
first state is drawn here as the script draws it (every entry in pencil, none
written), so nothing moves when the script arrives. ␣ is the space. A phone
shows one spelling per sum, a wider screen three; … says there are more.
Locals: entries (Cistergraphia::Notebook.entries: [{ sum:, seen:, spellings: }]), shut
(the expert plate: no entries yet, the way to find first; app.js opens it on
the way found, from the row template)
%>
<% shut_book = defined?(shut) ? shut : false %>
<% note = 'Each sum is one letter, however its pair is spelled. Write a letter in pencil against a sum; the scribe confirms entries three at a time.' %>
<section class="notebook awaits-script<%= ' is-shut' if shut_book %>" aria-labelledby="notebook-title" data-notebook data-notebook-sums="<%= JSON.generate(entries.map { |entry| entry[:sum] }) %>"<% if shut_book %> data-notebook-shut data-notebook-open-note="<%= note %>"<% end %>>
  <div class="notebook-head">
    <h2 id="notebook-title" class="index-heading">The notebook</h2>
    <span class="notebook-count" data-notebook-count aria-live="polite"><%= shut_book ? 'Shut until the way is found' : "0 of #{entries.size} in ink · asked 0 times" %></span>
  </div>
  <p class="notebook-note" data-notebook-note><%= shut_book ? 'Find the way first: three pairs along it whose sums are values of the tablet open the notebook, on every sum the way makes.' : note %></p>
  <div class="notebook-scroll">
    <table class="notebook-table">
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">Sum</th><th scope="col">Seen</th><th scope="col">Spelled</th><th scope="col">Reads as</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody data-notebook-rows>
        <% entries.each do |entry| %>
          <%== erb :_notebook_row, layout: false, locals: { entry: entry } %>
        <% end %>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <% if shut_book %><template data-notebook-row><%== erb :_notebook_row, layout: false, locals: { entry: { sum: 0, seen: 0, spellings: [] } } %></template><% end %>
  </div>
  <div class="notebook-ask">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" data-notebook-ask<%= ' disabled' if shut_book %>>Ask the scribe</button>
    <p class="notebook-verdict" data-notebook-verdict aria-live="polite">The scribe answers only when three entries hold at once.</p>
  </div>
</section>
